{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm-omni/pulls/5864","id":4220901393,"node_id":"PR_kwDOPtqWvc77ldgR","html_url":"https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-omni/pull/5864","diff_url":"https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-omni/pull/5864.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-omni/pull/5864.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm-omni/issues/5864","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm-omni/pulls/5864/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm-omni/pulls/5864/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm-omni/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm-omni/issues/5864/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm-omni/statuses/07fc831e7a43715309a33c24d310f12fc6713a53","number":5864,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[Diffusion] Fix DLO DP concurrent request execution","user":{"login":"lishunyang12","id":125541396,"node_id":"U_kgDOB3ucFA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125541396?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishunyang12","html_url":"https://github.com/lishunyang12","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishunyang12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishunyang12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishunyang12/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishunyang12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishunyang12/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishunyang12/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishunyang12/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishunyang12/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishunyang12/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Why\r\n\r\nFollow-up to #5764. DLO + AllGather can schedule one request per DP replica, but the multiprocess result path assumed one rank-0 result queue. An invalid or control-flow-incompatible request could fail on one DP replica while another replica entered AllGather, leaving the request wave hung.\r\n\r\nThis PR is intentionally scoped to DLO/DP request correctness, result routing, IPC, and shared worker lifecycle behavior.\r\n\r\n## Architecture\r\n\r\n```mermaid\r\nflowchart TB\r\n    U[API / Offline request] --> E[AsyncOmni / DiffusionEngine]\r\n    E --> S[RequestScheduler<br/>Collect up to DP-size requests]\r\n    S --> G{DLO + AllGather<br/>DP wave?}\r\n\r\n    G -- No --> N[Normal single-request path]\r\n    G -- Yes --> V[Wave preflight<br/>Shape / CFG / Steps / LoRA<br/>extra_args / non-empty prompt]\r\n    V -- Incompatible --> REJECT[Reject the whole wave<br/>before worker dispatch]\r\n    V -- Compatible --> EX[MultiprocDiffusionExecutor<br/>collective_rpc]\r\n    N --> EX\r\n    EX --> B[Broadcast MessageQueue<br/>same wave_id to every rank]\r\n\r\n    subgraph R0[DP replica 0: request A]\r\n        W0[Rank 0<br/>TP primary]\r\n        W1[Rank 1<br/>TP worker]\r\n    end\r\n\r\n    subgraph R1[DP replica 1: request B]\r\n        W2[Rank 2<br/>TP primary]\r\n        W3[Rank 3<br/>TP worker]\r\n    end\r\n\r\n    B --> W0\r\n    B --> W1\r\n    B --> W2\r\n    B --> W3\r\n\r\n    W0 <-->|Layer weight AllGather| W2\r\n    W1 <-->|Layer weight AllGather| W3\r\n\r\n    W0 --> Q0[Rank 0 result queue]\r\n    W2 --> Q2[Rank 2 result queue]\r\n    W1 -. Non-primary: no reply .-> NR[Execute only]\r\n    W3 -. Non-primary: no reply .-> NR\r\n\r\n    Q0 --> P0[Result pump 0]\r\n    Q2 --> P2[Result pump 2]\r\n    P0 --> C[Future / sync result buffer]\r\n    P2 --> C\r\n    C --> SORT[Sort by dp_rank]\r\n    SORT --> OUT[Return request A and B independently]\r\n\r\n    EX -- Wave timeout --> F[_is_failed = True]\r\n    F --> SD[shutdown<br/>single termination owner]\r\n    SD --> CLEAN[Send shutdown<br/>global 15s join]\r\n    CLEAN -->|Survivors| TERM[Terminate survivors<br/>global 5s join]\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n## Out of scope\r\n\r\nPer-replica SP communication groups and rank-local mmap sharing are a larger topology redesign and belong in a follow-up. This PR keeps the existing cross-DP AllGather topology, admits only compatible request waves, and fails closed on unforeseen asymmetry. It does not claim the pre-existing DLO memory reduction as a new benefit.\r\n","labels":[{"id":9262077338,"node_id":"LA_kwDOPtqWvc8AAAACKBAVmg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm-omni/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"Something isn't working","color":"d73a4a","default":true},{"id":10020291195,"node_id":"LA_kwDOPtqWvc8AAAACVUGCew","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm-omni/labels/high%20priority","name":"high priority","description":"high priority issue, needs to be done asap","color":"c53308","default":false},{"id":10501175256,"node_id":"LA_kwDOPtqWvc8AAAACces32A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm-omni/labels/diffusion","name":"diffusion","description":"codes related to diffusion models","color":"d1541a","default":false},{"id":10654757717,"node_id":"LA_kwDOPtqWvc8AAAACexKzVQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm-omni/labels/merge-test","name":"merge-test","description":"label to trigger buildkite merge test CI","color":"695d19","default":false}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-08-06T12:36:02Z","updated_at":"2026-08-28T14:53:49Z","closed_at":"2026-08-08T00:24:42Z","merged_at":"2026-08-08T00:24:42Z","merge_commit_sha":"44e38d7b3879107e501acfd833765ef07c60ace6","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"xuechendi","id":4355494,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTU0OTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4355494?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuechendi","html_url":"https://github.com/xu